What this notice has and has not been checked against
-----------------------------------------------------

The attributions here cover the dependencies that have been validated against
their published licences: everything compiled into the binaries Forge
distributes, and every source tree vendored into this repository.

Cargo.lock also resolves crates for targets Forge does not currently build —
Windows, Android, WebAssembly, Redox, and other platform-specific graphs. Those
have not been checked one by one. None of them is linked into anything
distributed here, and they are conventionally MIT or Apache-2.0, but this
notice does not assert that, because nobody has confirmed it yet. Checking the
remainder is outstanding work, and the intention is that this section
eventually describes an empty set.

If you are relying on this notice for a compliance review, that is the boundary
of what it currently claims.


